<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential raises Airtouch.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential raises Airtouch.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities upgraded AirTouch Communications Inc to buy from hold, a Prudential source said.</p>
<p>-- Earlier U S West Media Group said it was merging its domestic cellular business and its interest in PrimeCo Personal Communications into AirTouch in a $5 billion deal.</p>
<p>-- AirTouch was not immediately trading after closing Thursday at 23-1/2. U S West rose 3/4 to 18.</p>
</text>
